# Trial of the Soul with a test bot. The bot can't fight, so each wave is killed by command; the
# `neoforge tps` lines only give the next wave time to spawn (60 ticks first, 40 between waves).
# Expect: step=trial while running, then step=race with ttl.trial.passed=true, then step=unique with
# three ttl.uniqueOptions from the "knowledge" pool, then life2 with the chosen unique.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotTrial
neoforge tps
kill TtlBotTrial
neoforge tps
execute as TtlBotTrial run ttl wish knowledge
execute as TtlBotTrial run ttl trial
ttl inspect TtlBotTrial
neoforge tps
neoforge tps
neoforge tps
kill @e[tag=ttl_trial]
neoforge tps
neoforge tps
neoforge tps
kill @e[tag=ttl_trial]
neoforge tps
neoforge tps
neoforge tps
kill @e[tag=ttl_trial]
neoforge tps
ttl inspect TtlBotTrial
execute as TtlBotTrial run ttl choose slime
ttl inspect TtlBotTrial
tensura get ability list skill TtlBotTrial
ttl reset TtlBotTrial
ttlbot remove TtlBotTrial
